  initialPage: 0
  pages:
  - title: LEVEL 25 | Dual Path Power | Diode OR Gate
    explanation: Two positive-fed input branches, each with a switch and a forward
      diode, join at the input of one 330 Ohm resistor. The common resistor drives
      one green LED, returning to Battery_negative. Diode cathode bands face the
      resistor. These are teaching drawings, not live electrical results.
    caption: PAGE 1/4 | EITHER SWITCH POWERS THE LED
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.09, y: 0.48}
      label: 5 V
      color: {r: 0.98, g: 0.29, b: 0.35, a: 1}
    - id: swa
      kind: 5
      position: {x: 0.31, y: 0.78}
      label: SW A
