  - title: LEVEL 25 | Eight External Connections
    explanation: 'CONNECT 8 WIRES: (1) Battery_positive to SwitchA_Input; (2) Battery_positive
      to SwitchB_Input; (3) SwitchA_Output to D_OR_A_Anode; (4) SwitchB_Output to
      D_OR_B_Anode; (5) D_OR_A_Cathode to R_LIMIT_Input; (6) D_OR_B_Cathode to R_LIMIT_Input;
      (7) R_LIMIT_Output to LED_Anode; (8) LED_Cathode to Battery_negative. Both
      positive branches share Battery_positive, never Battery_negative. No diode
      bypass.'
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | BATTERY POSITIVE SPLITS TO BOTH SWITCHES
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.09, y: 0.48}
