  - title: LEVEL 25 | Diode OR Truth Table
    explanation: 'Switch A OFF / B OFF: LED OFF. A ON / B OFF: LED ON through D1.
      A OFF / B ON: LED ON through D2. A ON / B ON: LED ON. With both closed, the
      two diode paths may share current; the common resistor still limits LED current.
      The default Level Definition completes for A ON and B OFF; other truth-table
      states are manual tests.'
    caption: PAGE 3/4 | A OR B | 00 OFF, 10 ON, 01 ON, 11 ON
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.09, y: 0.48}
