  - title: LEVEL 25 | Verification & Five Targets
    explanation: 'BASE COMPLETION STATE: close Switch A, open Switch B. Verify source
      voltage 4.8-5.2 V; D1 forward drop 0.45-1.0 V; green LED ON; shared resistor
      current 5-8 mA; resistor drop 2.0-2.6 V. Use actual measured solver values
      for confirmation. Runtime IDs: R_LIMIT_Component/Input/Output, D_OR_A_Component/Anode/Cathode,
      D_OR_B_Component/Anode/Cathode. Fixed LED uses led / LED_Anode / LED_Cathode.
      Only SparkLevelEvaluator awards 5/5; the extra truth-table combinations are
      not auto-validated by this asset.'
    caption: PAGE 4/4 | 5 V | D1 0.45-1.0 V | LED ON | 5-8 mA
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.09, y: 0.48}
